Error [jet.InvalidStatement]: `$old` is not a compiler fact
  --> tests/ui/fact_root_unknown_dollar_word.jet:4:11
    |
  4 |     print($old)
    |           ^^^^
 Why: `$` marks only the site locations `$here` and `$caller`
 Fix: Drop the `$` from a plain name, or read a fact through its subject, such as `T.reflect().fields`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0003
